.idea
Chart.lock
/*/**/charts/*
# helm dependency build output (ArgoCD builds dependencies itself). The STUNner wrapper chart
# is the exception: its Chart.lock and dependency archive are committed so the chart contents
# are pinned and a render does not depend on l7mp.io being reachable.
!/charts/stunner/Chart.lock
!/charts/stunner/charts/
!/charts/stunner/charts/stunner-1.2.1.tgz
